  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">European Roma Rights Centre (ERRC) arbetar med strategisk             processf&#xF6;ring och f&#xF6;rdjupade studier f&#xF6;r att s&#xE4;kra romernas           r&#xE4;ttigheter. Insatsen omfattar Makedonien, Serbien, Turkiet och       Ukraina med aktiviteter inom omr&#xE5;dena f&#xF6;r kapacitetsutveckling f&#xF6;r    romska aktivister, utbildning, r&#xE4;tt till liv, tillg&#xE5;ng till r&#xE4;ttvisa, sk&#xE4;liga boendevillkor, tillg&#xE5;ng till sociala tj&#xE4;nster, r&#xF6;relsefrihet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Roma Rights Centre (ERRC) support Roma rights though         strategic litigation, research and advocacy. The project include      activities in Macedonia, Serbiam Turkey and Ukraine in the areas of   capcacity buliding for roma activists, right to education, right to   life, access to justice, right to adequate living, access to social   services, freedom of movement and non-discrimination.</narrative>
  </description>
